<title>GERMANY: Veba -upwards earnings trend stronger in Q3.</title>
<headline>Veba -upwards earnings trend stronger in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German diversified utility Veba AG said that the upwards trend in earnings in the third quarter of 1996 continued to strengthen.</p>
<p>The group said in a mandatory statement that pre-tax profit in the third quarter was 16.7 percent higher than the year-ago figure. It added that the third-quarter figure was higher than expected.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
